3.8<!-- -->/5.0</span></div></div><p class="_Btm_AK:LRx4d _Ocpc8R:gNxUK">Scored<!-- --> <time dateTime="2026-10-20T11:40:30.678894Z" title="21 days ago">2026-10-20 11:40</time> <!-- -->across <!-- -->3<!-- --> <!-- -->tools</p></div><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:HMbek"><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:HMbek"><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:HMbek"><div><div class="_Cr_m0U:EKCCM _SlOY66:H-q67 _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:Qm-SX _drhFNn:JYyH1"><div class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _Ocpc8R:1nrCd _syDQuH:QGeD- _p8a-Gy:y6YP2 _BUeTtS:785jn"><span class="_hF0vGB:RVr7q _nRd69H:Gzqxf _58FN9j:hMpVe _Btm_AK:XM0iz _0vvNua:zdhJU _drhFNn:eQv7Z">Disambiguation</span><span class="_Btm_AK:LRx4d">4<!-- -->/5</span></div><div class="_w1ddk4:3PkAo _Cr_m0U:EKCCM _97NnCm:fMESs _2EQUH3:q7Z1L _RO16FJ:Eyp8S"><div class="_Cr_m0U:EKCCM _97NnCm:WMjJL _drhFNn:LasKm" style="background:#37a169;width:80%"></div></div></div><div class="_Fg8Gj5:MxR3f _drhFNn:INcQs" style="grid-template-rows:0fr;opacity:0"><div class="_2EQUH3:q7Z1L"><p class="_Ocpc8R:1nrCd _p8a-Gy:y6YP2 _DJEIKl:fjj02">weather_now and air_quality_now target clearly distinct measurements, so they are easy to tell apart. nearby_sensors partially overlaps with both since it can return weather or air readings per layer, creating mild ambiguity about when to use it versus the dedicated tools.</p></div></div></div><div><div class="_Cr_m0U:EKCCM _SlOY66:H-q67 _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:Qm-SX _drhFNn:JYyH1"><div class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _Ocpc8R:1nrCd _syDQuH:QGeD- _p8a-Gy:y6YP2 _BUeTtS:785jn"><span class="_hF0vGB:RVr7q _nRd69H:Gzqxf _58FN9j:hMpVe _Btm_AK:XM0iz _0vvNua:zdhJU _drhFNn:eQv7Z">Naming Consistency</span><span class="_Btm_AK:LRx4d">4<!-- -->/5</span></div><div class="_w1ddk4:3PkAo _Cr_m0U:EKCCM _97NnCm:fMESs _2EQUH3:q7Z1L _RO16FJ:Eyp8S"><div class="_Cr_m0U:EKCCM _97NnCm:WMjJL _drhFNn:LasKm" style="background:#37a169;width:80%"></div></div></div><div class="_Fg8Gj5:MxR3f _drhFNn:INcQs" style="grid-template-rows:0fr;opacity:0"><div class="_2EQUH3:q7Z1L"><p class="_Ocpc8R:1nrCd _p8a-Gy:y6YP2 _DJEIKl:fjj02">air_quality_now and weather_now follow a consistent noun_now pattern, but nearby_sensors deviates from that convention. The deviation is minor and the name is still self-explanatory, so it is mostly consistent.</p></div></div></div><div><div class="_Cr_m0U:EKCCM _SlOY66:H-q67 _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:Qm-SX _drhFNn:JYyH1"><div class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _Ocpc8R:1nrCd _syDQuH:QGeD- _p8a-Gy:y6YP2 _BUeTtS:785jn"><span class="_hF0vGB:RVr7q _nRd69H:Gzqxf _58FN9j:hMpVe _Btm_AK:XM0iz _0vvNua:zdhJU _drhFNn:eQv7Z">Tool Count</span><span class="_Btm_AK:LRx4d">4<!-- -->/5</span></div><div class="_w1ddk4:3PkAo _Cr_m0U:EKCCM _97NnCm:fMESs _2EQUH3:q7Z1L _RO16FJ:Eyp8S"><div class="_Cr_m0U:EKCCM _97NnCm:WMjJL _drhFNn:LasKm" style="background:#37a169;width:80%"></div></div></div><div class="_Fg8Gj5:MxR3f _drhFNn:INcQs" style="grid-template-rows:0fr;opacity:0"><div class="_2EQUH3:q7Z1L"><p class="_Ocpc8R:1nrCd _p8a-Gy:y6YP2 _DJEIKl:fjj02">Three tools is a tight but reasonable scope for a live weather and air-quality service. Each tool covers a distinct measurement need, though the surface is on the lean side with no forecasting or historical option.</p></div></div></div><div><div class="_Cr_m0U:EKCCM _SlOY66:H-q67 _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:Qm-SX _drhFNn:JYyH1"><div class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _Ocpc8R:1nrCd _syDQuH:QGeD- _p8a-Gy:y6YP2 _BUeTtS:785jn"><span class="_hF0vGB:RVr7q _nRd69H:Gzqxf _58FN9j:hMpVe _Btm_AK:XM0iz _0vvNua:zdhJU _drhFNn:eQv7Z">Completeness</span><span class="_Btm_AK:LRx4d">4<!-- -->/5</span></div><div class="_w1ddk4:3PkAo _Cr_m0U:EKCCM _97NnCm:fMESs _2EQUH3:q7Z1L _RO16FJ:Eyp8S"><div class="_Cr_m0U:EKCCM _97NnCm:WMjJL _drhFNn:LasKm" style="background:#37a169;width:80%"></div></div></div><div class="_Fg8Gj5:MxR3f _drhFNn:INcQs" style="grid-template-rows:0fr;opacity:0"><div class="_2EQUH3:q7Z1L"><p class="_Ocpc8R:1nrCd _p8a-Gy:y6YP2 _DJEIKl:fjj02">The current/live domain is well covered: current weather, current air quality, and nearest sensors across layers. Forecasts and historical data are absent, but the server&#x27;s stated purpose is live conditions, so the gap is minor.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="_w1ddk4:uiC1T _Ucco6y:drLHy _Cr_m0U:5512o _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:TpG7X _DJEIKl:9b02c _km4GAs:L9MEn" id="tools"><div class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _syDQuH:QGeD-"><h2 class="_Ocpc8R:yfWZ6 _0vvNua:zdhJU">Available Tools</h2><span class="_w1ddk4:iDaqu _Cr_m0U:8tVEQ _Btm_AK:kTMI_ _Ocpc8R:YKzrX _0vvNua:rz6Y2 _DJEIKl:MvriA">3<!-- --> tool<!-- -->s</span></div><div class="_Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:NzUKm _uetrIO:HMbek"><details class="_3jPi_F:gUv6J _YqIKTr:i-aEn _JZNFJc:2jGB8 _km4GAs:L9MEn" id="air_quality_now"><summary class="_excC10:Yjn68 _akq2iH:OWa1l _IS_uqi:osDiy _SlOY66:H-q67 _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _Ocpc8R:1nrCd _0vvNua:rz6Y2 _uetrIO:Hm1eQ _syDQuH:QGeD- _MQJx2I:mwtuQ"><span class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _uetrIO:Hm1eQ _ac11qz:-xl9C"><svg class="_z5siZB:oHuRD _pgxS11:HqETg _drhFNn:-0ktT" fill="currentColor" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><use href="/icons.svg#i-chevron-right"></use></svg><a href="/mcp/connectors/dev.modelmarket/weather/tools/air_quality_now" class="_nRd69H:m9aZV _Btm_AK:Lxv-o _XRP-xG:VnTOU _2EQUH3:q7Z1L _anX-2R:1d1Ns _dzrkNA:9nOJP __6fUBu:Eudvc">air_quality_now</a><span class="_Btm_AK:LRx4d _Ocpc8R:gNxUK _2EQUH3:q7Z1L _dzrkNA:9nOJP __6fUBu:Eudvc">Current air quality</span><span class="_p8a-Gy:tjomT _AebxIj:WDIP7" style="background:#37a16920;border-radius:2px;color:#37a169;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;padding:2px 4px">A</span><div class="_IS_uqi:osDiy _Fg8Gj5:vasr3 _h64iL6:ZPAIx _uetrIO:a8ScB"><span class="_Cr_m0U:EKCCM _Ocpc8R:0YeZs _0vvNua:zdhJU _p8a-Gy:tjomT _DJEIKl:4cgpW _AebxIj:WDIP7" style="background:#69858020;color:#698580">Read-only</span>